        "content": "<p>I am trying to use <code>Base.Experimental.register_error_hint</code> with <code>StackOverflowError</code> but it hangs:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Julia\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">Base</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Experimental</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">register_error_hint</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">StackOverflowError</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">io</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exc</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">argtypes</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">kwargs</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exc</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">intersection</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">io</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"s\">\"\"\"</span>\n\n<span class=\"s\">        Are you sure that an intersection method is implemented for the given pair of geometries?</span>\n\n<span class=\"s\">        \"\"\"</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">printstyled</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">io</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"s\">\"\"\"</span>\n<span class=\"s\">        julia&gt; methods(intersection)</span>\n<span class=\"s\">        \"\"\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>